      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Interpretation boundary\nThis dashboard stores only data collected after the local stack starts. It cannot recover prior runs. Actuator timer metrics expose count/sum/max; exact p95 requires histograms and is not inferred here. Use time-window correlation with k6, server CPU/memory, and MySQL data; these charts alone do not prove a JVM-level bottleneck.",
